        <mxCell id="legend_box" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda de Papéis Arquiteturais (Laravel Modular):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;font-size:11px; margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#DAE8FC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controller / Middleware&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#D5E8D4; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFE6CC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Repository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#E1D5E7; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DTO / Request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#FFF2CC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Resource&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F5F5F5; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Entity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;width:15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;background:#F8CECC; border:1px solid #000; padding:2px 8px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Interface&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1037" width="2000" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note_impl_admin" value="&lt;b&gt;Regras de Implementação da Área D (Administração e Governança):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Camadas e Responsabilidades:&lt;/b&gt; UserController e ProtectedAreaController expõem endpoints REST e delegam exclusivamente a Services de domínio.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Validação e Integridade:&lt;/b&gt; UserAdminService valida regras R-1 e R-2 do UC008; auto-bloqueio (E1) e auto-alteração de perfil (E3) retornam HTTP 403 FORBIDDEN.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Soft Delete e Reativação:&lt;/b&gt; Exclusão lógica com deletedAt; reativação via UserAdminService.restore restaura status active; login com conta excluída/anonimizada retorna HTTP 401 unauthenticated (D8, ADR-0014, TC262).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Segurança e Sessões:&lt;/b&gt; JwtGuard.revoke(jti, ttl) invalida jti no Redis blocklist (D7); refresh sessions do usuário são revogadas no banco (D-TC243, D-TC258).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Auditoria Imutável:&lt;/b&gt; Toda alteração cadastral (status/role), soft delete e negação de acesso (UC016 E2) aciona obrigatoriamente AuditService.logAction / logAccessDenied, gravando em audit_logs particionada mensalmente (ADR-0016, RNF016).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tratamento de Erros:&lt;/b&gt; Exceções (401 UNAUTHENTICATED, 403 FORBIDDEN, 404 NOT_FOUND, 422 VALIDATION_FAILED) seguem ApiException do TDD 3.1; não são desenhadas como classes." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1097" width="2000" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
